; Handler of the word QUIT
;
; Prints the score (#R$83F5), waits for a key and restarts the game at #R$6C27,
; which restores the starting state and the title wait.
; .
; Hardware: reads the keyboard port $FE (all half-rows) in a polling loop.
@label=WordQuit
c$8391 CALL $83F5           ; "You have mastered ..% Of this adventure."
@label=WordQuit_Wait
*$8394 XOR A                ; A = 0 selects every half-row
@isub=IN A,(PORT_ULA)
 $8395 IN A,($FE)
@isub=AND KEY_BITS
 $8397 AND $1F
@isub=CP KEY_BITS
 $8399 CP $1F               ; no key down
 $839B JR Z,$8394
 $839D JP $6C27             ; restart the game
